"including species, number of genes and conditions, and experimental "
"design. Useful for understanding what data is available before querying "
"specific gene expression. Example: E-MTAB-2836 has 29 conditions "
"(tissues) and profiles for thousands of genes in Homo sapiens."
msgstr ""

